Portions of the visual-hull space carving, Surface Nets implicit-surface
polygonization, foreground-normalized interior comparison, deterministic
material comparison, reference-image de-lighting, and extruded-profile hole authoring are adapted from
img2threejs, Copyright 2026 hoainho, licensed under Apache License 2.0.
Morphloom converted and modified those implementations for bounded in-browser
TypeScript execution, typed-array geometry, linear-light colour correction,
bounded downsampled lighting fields, and its evidence/quality pipeline.
Upstream: https://github.com/img2threejs/img2threejs
