Binary glTF conformance checks use glTF Validator, Copyright The Khronos
Group Inc., licensed under Apache License 2.0. The validator runs locally on
the exact delivery bytes; Morphloom does not upload customer assets for this
check.
Upstream: https://github.com/KhronosGroup/glTF-Validator

Independent binary glTF parsing and physical-material extension registration
