MIT License.
Upstream: https://github.com/donmccurdy/glTF-Transform

Node-side cross-domain export fixtures use @napi-rs/canvas, Copyright its
contributors, licensed under the MIT License. It provides an in-memory Canvas
implementation so the same deterministic PBR textures exported in the browser
can be validated without uploading source assets.
Upstream: https://github.com/Brooooooklyn/canvas

